itics</strong> \u2013 Each day brings new rules, restrictions, and unexpected events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Dynamic encounters</strong> \u2013 Refugees, spies, smugglers, soldiers, and desperate families - each with unique stories and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Dynamic environment and weather</strong> \u2013 Each day looks a little different. The political situation changes, and so do the shapes of the borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Branching outcomes</strong> \u2013 Become a hero of the people, a loyal instrument of the regime, or remain lost in the gray zone between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Replay value</strong> \u2013 Treat people differently and experience new endings to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Distinctive style</strong> \u2013 A semi-realistic visual look inspired by <strong>socialist propaganda art</strong> and <strong>Cold War-era paintings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/452270b868c51914f2faa0ec1df372ab.poster.avif?t=1764184201\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/452270b868c51914f2faa0ec1df372ab.webm?t=1764184201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/452270b868c51914f2faa0ec1df372ab.mp4?t=1764184201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the border, truth is never black and white.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every decision leaves a mark - on others, and on You.</strong></p>","developers":["Frostember Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"descr